age/upload/t_thumb/sc145ge.jpg"}, {"id": 1873311, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc145gf.jpg"}, {"id": 1873312, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc145gg.jpg"}], "slug": "sirens", "storyline": "The game concept is based on a theory in which the evolution of humanity was at some point diverged. The complex organism that chose to leave the ocean and conquer the lands was divided. Part of the species decided to stay in the water and evolve there. Perfecting their physical bodies, these beings began to exhibit more and more traits typical of marine creatures, giving rise to humanoid mermaids who never experienced life on land, evolving underwater.", "summary": "Become a deadly Siren and hunt down the most dangerous sea creatures that have ever swum in the depths of the oceans! Experience a fascinating journey through the world as seen from the perspective of Sirens at various stages of their evolution.\n\nSirens is an underwater exploration and narrative-driven game where freedom of movement and emotional connection to the world matter more than checklists, quests, and numbers. Simply swimming and discovering secrets is not enough. We want the player to feel like a part of the ocean, to have a real impact on it, and to experience an environment that reacts to their actions in a natural, organic way.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/sirens", "videos": [{"id": 192387, "name": "Gameplay Trailer", "video_id": "FxyntIxtJOc", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FxyntIxtJOc", "title": "SIRENS: Official Gameplay Reveal", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/FxyntIxtJOc/fhddefault.jpg"}, {"id": 189461, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "onLZ0DPKOZU", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=onLZ0DPKOZU", "title": "Northern Isle preview", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/onLZ0DPKOZU/fhddefault.jpg"}, {"id": 189462, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "PnLIwLDWjr4", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PnLIwLDWjr4", "title": "SIRENS: Nyr Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/PnLIwLDWjr4/fhddefault.jpg"}, {"id": 189463, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "EiFy_bR5HK0", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=EiFy_bR5HK0", "title": "SIRENS: Official Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/EiFy_bR5HK0/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}